    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "zhCN": "tree-select/zh-cn/CustomTrigger",
      "enUS": "tree-select/en-us/CustomTrigger",
      "notes": "triggerRender/renderTagItem改#trigger/#tag；保留TagInput搜索、key回填、标签删除；中文自定义触发器的数据value与label一致。"
