    {
      "index": 19,
      "zhCN": "tree-select/zh-cn/SelectedItem",
      "enUS": "tree-select/en-us/SelectedItem",
      "notes": "单选与完全自定义标签用#selectedItem；保留isRenderInTag=true函数prop。中文白色Tag可关闭，英文按上游不增加关闭按钮。"
